- Context: This is the first page of a resume belonging to R. A. Udara Sandeepani Rajamanthri, detailing their professional experience and skills as a Senior Web Developer and Digital Designer with expertise in WordPress and UI/UX.
- Text: R. A. Udara Sandeepani Rajamanthri SENIOR WEB DEVELOPER | DIGITAL DESIGNER | WORDPRESS & UI/UX Creative and technically skilled Digital Designer and Web Developer with over 5 years of experience building and maintaining WordPress-based websites, managing hosting and DNS, and designing engaging digital assets for IT and B2B audiences. Proficient in tools like Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, Elementor, and cPanel, with a strong understanding of responsive design, UX strategy, and server-side performance. Adept at collaborating across technical and creative teams to deliver results-focused solutions. udyraja@gmail.com +94 77 1667502 Colombo, Sri Lanka LinkedIn WORK EXPERIENCE SENIOR - WEB DEVELOPER & UI/UX DESIGNER ARC Document Solutions, USA I Ninearch solution Pvt ltd January 2025 - Present / Full-Time • Led setup, customization, and management of Digital Storefront (DSF) websites, driving smooth operations, order fulfillment, and platform improvements. • Directed WordPress and Shopify development, integrating WooCommerce/Shopify solutions with UX-driven eCommerce strategies. • Championed UX research, usability testing, and A/B experiments, achieving 25-30% growth in conversions and engagement. • Oversaw design of wireframes, prototypes, and navigation flows in Figma/Adobe XD, establishing scalable and consistent design systems. • Guided frontend performance enhancements with responsive, accessible, and mobile-first designs using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP. • Managed digital assets, product listings, and CMS workflows, ensuring accuracy, branding consistency, and efficiency. • Provided leadership in web development and UI/UX design, mentoring junior team members and steering projects from concept to successful launch. SPECIALIST - WEB DEVELOPER & UX/UI DESIGNER MindVision Interactive, Australia I SydPro Pvt ltd July 2020 Dec 2024 / Full-Time • UI/UX Design & Strategy • Increased conversion rates by up to 30% through user research, competitor analysis, usability testing, and A/B experiments. • Designed wireframes, prototypes, storyboards, and site maps to streamline and enhance user journeys. • Built responsive, accessible, and brand-consistent interfaces for web and mobile platforms. • Optimized CTAs, layouts, and navigation flows, improving engagement by ~25%. • Collaborated with developers, marketers, and stakeholders to deliver end-to-end design solutions. • Proficient in Figma, Adobe XD, Sketch, and other prototyping/testing tools. • WordPress & Shopify Development • Built, customized, and maintained WordPress websites using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP, Elementor, and WPBakery. • Developed and optimized Shopify stores and WooCommerce integrations with strong eCommerce UX. • Managed domains, DNS records, and hosting configurations (cPanel, third-party DNS) while ensuring smooth migrations with minimal downtime. • Enhanced site performance through image optimization, code minification, responsive design, and frontend performance best practices. • Integrated plugins, designed intuitive dashboards, and ensured cross-browser/mobile compatibility. • Monitored uptime and server health, providing proactive technical support that reduced resolution times by 30%.
