- Context: This page contains the skills and experience of a professional, detailing their technical and soft skills, key achievements in web design and development, and portfolio links. It also includes their contact information.
- Text: TECHNICAL SKILLS • CMS & Hosting: WordPress (custom themes, Elementor, WPBakery), cPanel, DNS Management, Domain Setup • Frontend / Backend : HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, Responsive Web Design, PHP, MySQL • Creative & Design Skills: Digital Ads, Banners, Landing Pages; Social Media Design (Canva, Adobe Photoshop) • UX Research, A/B Testing; Typography, Branding, Visual Hierarchy; SaaS & B2B Tech Design Experience • UX Tools: Figma, Adobe XD, Sketch, Lucidchart • Performance: On-page SEO, Technical SEO, Keyword Research, Google Search Console, GA4, Site Audits • Cloud/Infra: Azure, Website Migration, Server Monitoring, Backups • Tools: Git, Google Analytics, Autotask (basic), Microsoft 365 SOFT SKILLS • Proactive and solutions-focused mindset • Excellent written and verbal communication • Able to translate technical issues to non-technical audiences • Effective prioritization of urgent tasks • Accountability and independent problem-solving KEY ACHIEVEMENTS • Pawfect Balance – WordPress website design & development, app design. Improved user engagement by 40%. Proactive and solutions-focused mindset • Clubroom - Website design & development. Optimized site speed, reducing load time by 30%. • MeForMe - WordPress website & app design. Enhanced UI, leading to a 15% increase in customer retention. • MindVision Interactive – Website redesign (In Progress). Focus on a modern, clean, and user-friendly experience. • Scout Australia Learning Platform – UX/UI redesign. Improved accessibility and course navigation for students. • Conducted technical audits and optimized on-page SEO for multiple WordPress websites. • Increased organic traffic by 30% through targeted keyword research and content optimization • Enhanced call-to-action engagement by 25% through design A/B testing and UX improvements • UI/UX Portfolio Link PORTFOLIO LINK • Design Portfolio Link Ragulan Tharmakulasingam Founder and Director of Epitom REFERENCES Digital, Pick a Book, Sri Lanka. 071 303 2422 ragulan@pickabook.club
